{
  "_doc": "头显品类字段表（Apple Vision Pro 起）。结构性特点：双芯片（主芯片 M 系列 + 传感专用 R1），重量按「含标配头带/遮光罩」口径（官网 Device Weight），电池为**外置**随行电源（官网单独标注重量），续航分通用/视频两口径取通用值。分辨率官网口径是「2300 万像素 3D 显示系统」（非 w×h），故无 resolutionPx 字段、像素信息进 display.type 原文。",
  "version": 1,
  "fields": [
    {
      "path": "body.weightG",
      "label": "机身重量",
      "unit": "g",
      "type": "number",
      "range": [
        400,
        1200
      ],
      "dir": null,
      "quantifiable": true,
      "group": "body",
      "note": "含 Light Seal 与头带，官网区间口径录下限（600-650g → 600）；外置电池单独 353g 不含"
    },
    {
      "path": "body.material",
      "label": "机身材质",
      "unit": null,
      "type": "string",
      "range": null,
      "dir": null,
      "quantifiable": false,
      "group": "body"
    },
    {
      "path": "body.colors",
      "label": "配色",
      "unit": null,
      "type": "array:string",
      "range": null,
      "dir": null,
      "quantifiable": false,
      "group": "body"
    },
    {
      "path": "display.type",
      "label": "显示系统",
      "unit": null,
      "type": "string",
      "range": null,
      "dir": null,
      "quantifiable": false,
      "group": "display",
      "note": "官网原文含像素口径（2300 万像素 3D 显示系统 micro-OLED）"
    },
    {
      "path": "display.refreshHz",
      "label": "刷新率",
      "unit": null,
      "type": "string",
      "range": null,
      "dir": null,
      "quantifiable": false,
      "group": "display",
      "note": "官网多档刷新率（90Hz/96Hz/100Hz/120Hz），录可解析区间形态"
    },
    {
